From: slwyts <slwyts@foxmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 03:44:04 +0800
Subject: backlight: ktz8866: report hardware brightness and dimming scale

Read the latched brightness from both KTZ8866 controllers and require
them to agree. Report zero when the LED strings are disabled and
advertise a dimming scale only when both chips share the same mode.
Serialize reads with brightness updates so the reported level cannot
mix bytes from different writes.

Reuse the readback at probe for the original bootloader handoff. Propagate
partial-write errors and allow the next update to retry.

Link: https://github.com/slwyts/Project-SunUEFI/commit/276dac061a74e6416678b4fb6ae2bf43c708c000
Signed-off-by: slwyts <slwyts@foxmail.com>
---
 drivers/video/backlight/ktz8866.c | 98 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 83 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/video/backlight/ktz8866.c b/drivers/video/backlight/ktz8866.c
index c237fe1aeeeaf33f9a88e810c285ed2a73625bf5..377d535b303bfa8ad1cde8fa3a5627347890f205 100644
--- a/drivers/video/backlight/ktz8866.c
